      "title": "Note: Model Links",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Model Links\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   ├── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n```\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -2030,
        4850
      ],
      "size": [
        450,
        860
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 Image to Video (vlo)\n\n[MiniMax H3](https://www.minimax.io/blog/minimax-h3) generates video with **native stereo audio** — voice, sound effects and music are modelled jointly in a single forward pass, not layered on afterward.\n\n## About this workflow\n\nThe `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` node covers two tasks with the same checkpoint:\n\n- **t2va** (text to video + audio) when neither keyframe is provided\n- **fl2va** (first / last frame) when either keyframe is provided\n\nBoth **Start frame** and **End frame** are optional in vlo: leave both empty for a pure text-to-video generation, or provide either one on its own.\n\n**Key inputs**\n\n- **Start frame / End frame**: optional keyframes; the model generates the motion between them. Each is stretched to the generation canvas first, so both keyframes are treated identically.\n- **Prompt**: describe the shots, motion, and the accompanying audio (dialogue, SFX, music) in one block\n- **Width / Height**: driven by vlo's resolution and aspect-ratio controls. H3's native canvas is a 768px short edge, capped at 768x1344 pixels, rounded to a multiple of 32\n- **Length**: frame count at 24fps on the model's 17k+5 grid, so the vlo slider runs 22 frames (~0.9s) to 600 frames (25s) in steps of 17"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
